# Cloudflare Pages Redirects - SEO Canonicalization
# Force all traffic to https://bankholidaycalendar.com

# 1. Redirect pages.dev default domain to canonical apex
https://bankholidaycalendar.pages.dev/*  https://bankholidaycalendar.com/:splat  301!

# 2. Redirect www to apex (HTTPS)
https://www.bankholidaycalendar.com/*    https://bankholidaycalendar.com/:splat  301!

# 3. Redirect www to apex (HTTP)
http://www.bankholidaycalendar.com/*     https://bankholidaycalendar.com/:splat  301!

# 4. Redirect http apex to https apex
http://bankholidaycalendar.com/*         https://bankholidaycalendar.com/:splat  301!
